// Default build settings, applied to both Debug and Release.
//
// Real configuration lives in Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored). The
// optional include below pulls it in when present and silently
// no-ops when not — meaning the project still builds cleanly on a
// fresh clone before anyone has pasted credentials, with empty
// placeholders in Info.plist that the in-app Settings sheet can
// fill in at runtime (see SecretsStore.swift).
//
// The Google Maps API key is no longer a build setting: the
// backend proxy holds it server-side and the iOS app talks to the
// proxy via App Attest. Only the backend URL lives here.
//
// xcconfig precedence: later assignments win. So the empty default
// here is overridden by Secrets.xcconfig if it defines the same key.

PENUMBRA_BACKEND_URL =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
